    "raw": "Disturbing notes of a madman.",
    "value": "疯子所写的令人不安的笔记。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The find I have just made rewrites the knowledge of the cosmos in its entirety. There are ruins past the mountain. It was a treacherous climb but well worth it. If my initial scans are correct, this site is well over 90 million years old.",
    "value": "山峦另一侧的发现彻底颠覆了我对宇宙的认知。那是一座险峻而陡峭的山峰，攀登异常艰难，却终究值得。若仪器扫描无误，此废墟已存在逾九千万年。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "These ruins match no known species, language or style I am aware of. Something about them is wrong, though. The angles are just...off. Dimensions seem larger or smaller than they should. It makes no sense, and it warps my perception to stare at them for any moderate length of time.",
    "value": "此处的建筑风格、铭文与壁画，与任何已知文明皆不相符。它们的存在本身便违背常理，结构的角度扭曲异常，维度时大时小，凝视稍久，便觉神智恍惚，感知渐被扭曲。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "I think maybe MacReady wasn't as crazy as we thought. I think something was in that corpse I brought back. I found more of these things, and with the tests I ran...well, they're still alive. Somehow, they still function. And one of them is back at the base with everyone else!",
    "value": "或许麦克雷迪并不如我们所想的那般疯狂。我怀疑自己带回的那具尸骸中潜藏着某种邪秽。而在这里，我发现了更多此类...生物。它们竟仍存活，甚至仍在运作。更可怕的是，其中一只已随我们返回基地。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "I wonder how deep these ruins go? I've found a passage down, and find myself in a deep and ancient temple. There is no light to speak of, and utter silence reigns. It's oppressive. But these carvings, this language. Every tile tells a story.",
    "value": "废墟深处究竟延伸至何处？我沿通道下行，踏入一座沉埋于黑暗的古老神庙。此地无光无声，压抑至极。但每一块石砖、每一道刻纹，都在无声诉说着往事。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "There are pictograms on some tiles, giving visual representation of events to some degree. While much is uncertain, there was definitely a civilization here. Their people flourished here and through science birthed a new race. Slaves. But all slaves eventually rebel.",
    "value": "部分砖石上刻有象形图案，似是记录重大事件的唯一方式。虽仍有许多未解之处，但可确信此处曾存在一个文明。他们在此繁衍生息，凭借某种技术创造出新的种族作为奴隶。然而奴隶终将反抗。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/5",
    "raw": "These slave beings rose up and slaughtered most of their creators, until a truce was made and the Old Ones left this place save for the few required to keep the Slaves contained. The slave-things are some sort of amorphous, shapeless mass.",
    "value": "这些奴隶生物奋起屠戮了造物主，直至达成停战，古老的“原族”离去，仅留少数在此看守。所谓奴隶，实为某种无定形、无实体之混沌存在。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/6",
    "raw": "I've found some sort of liquid pool that is not unlike the waters found outside. Even a slight touch of it makes me feel strange. There's no way forward, so I am going to brave the pool...see what's within. I've jury-rigged a device I hope can protect me from the effects.",
    "value": "我发现了一池异样液体，触之即感心神异样。前方已无路可走，唯有潜入此池一探究竟。我临时拼凑了一套供氧装置，但愿它能护我免受侵蚀。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/7",
    "raw": "My mind is slowly falling away and I can feel the bliss of madness knocking at my cerebellum. I won't yet welcome insanity. Not until I've seen the end of this place. I found some sort of combination switch. I'll tinker with it until I can access whatever it protects. I have little choice. I can hear things in the darkness, including gutteral chants in some hideous tongue.",
    "value": "理智正缓缓消散，疯狂的甜美不断叩击着我的小脑。但我还不能屈服。除非我亲眼见证此地的终局。我找到一组组合开关，不断尝试直至打开它所守护之物。我已无退路，黑暗中传来阵阵低语，夹杂着某种可憎语言的嘶吼。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/8",
    "raw": "No, I will not stop the sweetness or halt the spread of this madness. I feel the need to find It. I have snuck past some horrid sentries and now go to meet with my new God. I can hear it undulating deep below. I will eat its sacrament. I found it anyway, so it's mine and I'm hungry to take what belongs to me.",
    "value": "不，我不会阻止这甜美的蔓延，也不会抗拒这疯狂的侵蚀。我感到一种迫切的需要，必须找到“祂”。我躲过了可怖的守卫，如今即将面见我的新神。我能听见祂在深处蠕动。我将享用祂赐予的圣餐。既已寻得，它便属于我，我渴望吞噬属于我的一切。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/9",
    "raw": "It gave me a most special task. I brought its babies back to share with the others. We can all be perfect together. We can all be as one with the Watcher in the Deep. It will fill us with need and sweet, sweet hunger. Come my friends, let us share in the feast...",
    "value": "祂赋予我一项特殊的使命：我将祂的子嗣带回，与他人共享。我们将一同臻至完美，与深渊中的守望者合为一体。祂将填满我们的渴望，赐予甜美而饥渴的欢愉。来吧，我的朋友，共赴这场盛宴...."
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/10",
    "raw": "I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back.I should have turned back... (96 more pages of this continue)",
    "value": "我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的。我早该回头的...（此后重复九十六页）"
